Point-LIO: ROS 1 (Noetic) → ROS 2 (Humble) 移植补丁
上游: https://github.com/hku-mars/Point-LIO  (master, 1510c3b)
应用: cd ~/pointlio_ws/src && git clone https://github.com/hku-mars/Point-LIO.git point_lio
      cd point_lio && patch -p1 < 0003-pointlio-ros2-port.patch

改动概要:
  · CMakeLists.txt / package.xml: catkin → ament_cmake
  · 新增 include/ros2_compat.h: stamp2sec / to_rcl_time / ROS_INFO 宏兼容层
  · 消息类型: ros/Xxx.h → xxx/msg/xxx.hpp; livox_ros_driver → livox_ros_driver2
  · 时间: header.stamp.toSec() → stamp2sec(header.stamp)
  · 节点: ros::NodeHandle → rclcpp::Node; 订阅/发布者 → create_subscription/publisher
  · TF: tf::TransformBroadcaster → tf2_ros::TransformBroadcaster
  · 参数: nh.param<T>() → get_param<T>() 辅助函数；名字 a/b → a.b
  · 新增 config/mid360.yaml + launch/mapping_mid360.launch.py

